        "id": 1976127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T06:10:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The DynamicConfig feature has provided two modes to get configs: remote mode and local mode. The remote mode has been deprecated and the local mode requires the settings explicitly. This cl is to utilize the local mode to decouple the IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL from the test and make it configurable.",
      "parentUuid": "7f840d4f_9c35bcaa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "bafd34a66551444c7efff43089f65605485ec95f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b37b14a7_eb5b8896",
        "filename": "tests/cts/net/DynamicConfig.xml",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T07:32:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the remote mode is deprecated, why do tests like this one need to explicitly disable it? Can\u0027t we disable it by default tree-wide?",
      "parentUuid": "4d866213_75ed9bdb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "bafd34a66551444c7efff43089f65605485ec95f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c9922cc5_59f514e9",
        "filename": "tests/cts/net/DynamicConfig.xml",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1976127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T10:43:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The remote mode is currently under maintenance mode. Certain legacy tests still utilize this feature, but new tests should not use it. Sorry for the confusion.\n\nIn summary, both modes are being used in the code base and this setting is to differentiate local mode from remote mode. Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "b37b14a7_eb5b8896",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "bafd34a66551444c7efff43089f65605485ec95f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "34e24194_2d44afac",
        "filename": "tests/cts/net/DynamicConfig.xml",
        "patchSetId": 9
