      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T10:37:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I get that both configurations are in use. But if remote_config_required\u003dtrue is deprecated, then why can\u0027t we make remote_config_required default to false?\n\nIf we don\u0027t do that, then every new test we add will need to say remote_config_required \u003d false, like we do here.\n\nIt seems better to:\n- Change the tests that require remote config to set remote_config_required\u003dtrue in their DynamicConfig.xml.\n- Change the default in DynamicConfig.java to false.",
      "parentUuid": "c9922cc5_59f514e9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "bafd34a66551444c7efff43089f65605485ec95f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0fdae564_480b0cbd",
        "filename": "tests/cts/net/DynamicConfig.xml",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1976127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T13:30:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can but we need to do it carefully.\n\nFor the existing remote config tests, if remote_config_required default to true, the test will fail if users can\u0027t retrieve latest remote configs. If we change the default to false, there is a risk that users can use the local configs (which might be outdated) to pass these tests.\n\nWe don\u0027t want to silently change the behavior until we get confirmation from test owners who maintain these remote config tests that they are Okay with it.\n\nIs it possible to make the DynamicConfig refactoring separate from this cl? Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "34e24194_2d44afac",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "bafd34a66551444c7efff43089f65605485ec95f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
