      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T06:10:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We will not fetch the value remotely from the server side at the runtime (remote mode of DynamicConfig) because 1) the remode mode has been deprecated 2) we will have to detect user\u0027s location to return IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL dynamically.\n\nInstead, we will use the local mode to provide the value for IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL. The config xml file will be packaged into the CTS tool and if users can access .com service (which is for the majority users), they are able to get the value seamlessly from the xml file. If users have to access .cn service, we will provide a separate xml file to provide .cn IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL for them.",
      "parentUuid": "c8ff521c_b3bd7447",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "bafd34a66551444c7efff43089f65605485ec95f",
