      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T07:32:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. But still, the current CL specifies the URL three times. Once in this file, once in ALLOWED_IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URLS and once when setting sIpAddressEchoUrl. Can we reduce that duplication? Perhaps we could rename this key to IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL_OVERRIDE and make default it to empty? Then the code could do something like:\n\n    private static final String IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL \u003d\n            \"https://google-ipv6test.appspot.com/ip.js?fmt\u003dtext\";\n    private static final List\u003cString\u003e ALLOWED_IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL_OVERRIDES \u003d List.of(\n            \"https://ipv6test.googleapis-cn.com/ip.js?fmt\u003dtext\");\n\n\nand then in updateSettingsFromConfig:\n\n            final String overrideUrl \u003d dynamicConfig.getValue(\"IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL_OVERRIDE\");\n            if (ALLOWED_IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL_OVERRIDES.contains(overrideUrl)) {\n                sIpAddressEchoUrl \u003d overrideUrl;\n            } else {\n                sIpAddressEchoUrl \u003d IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URL;\n            }",
      "parentUuid": "98924828_ce6db03e",
