      "side": 1,
      "message": "I dedup the URL in the ConnectivityManagerTest.java so that only once in this file and once in ALLOWED_IP_ADDRESS_ECHO_URLS. Does it sound good to you?\n\nI would like to leverage the existing VPN-free solution go/vpn-free-xts which supports URL replacement functionality. But the restriction is the url that will be replaced (.com domain in this case) should be stated in the DynamicConfig.xml file.",
