      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T10:43:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, they don\u0027t need to.\n\n1. DynamicConfig.xml will be packaged into each module respectively (this is to support different configs on different modules, though they are same in our example), Tradefed will read the file under the module sub-directory to get the configs.\n2. Tradefed supports to override the URL added in the DynamicConfig.xml at suite level if UrlReplacement.xml exits. So if someone wants to override the URL, the only thing they need to do is to put the file under the cts tool root directory.\n\nAn simpler solution for users is we update the test logic to 1) try to connect to .com domain, 2) if timeout try to connect to .cn domain like what Patchset 6 did. But I have dropped it. Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "0d3aba2c_5b8cbbfd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 334,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 334,
        "endChar": 29
      },
