      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T13:30:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If someone can access the .com service, everything will work as you described and they don’t need to do anything else.\n\nWhile if someone can’t access the .com service and wants to override the URL. They just need to put a file UrlReplacement.xml with a list of \u003creplaced URL, new URL\u003e to CTS root directory. DynamicConfigPusher will do the replacement at L275 with the help of UrlReplacement.java and DynamicConfigHandler.java.",
      "parentUuid": "4229e1a6_b4f30d11",
